    {
      "source": "Returns <a href=\"BeanDefinitionUtils.EntityManagerFactoryBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jpa.util\"><code>BeanDefinitionUtils.EntityManagerFactoryBeanDefinition</code></a> instances for all <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> registered in the given\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/ConfigurableListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ConfigurableListableBeanFactory</code></a> hierarchy.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/ConfigurableListableBeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ConfigurableListableBeanFactory</code></a> 层次结构中所有已注册的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> 对应的 <a href=\"BeanDefinitionUtils.EntityManagerFactoryBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.jpa.util\"><code>BeanDefinitionUtils.EntityManagerFactoryBeanDefinition</code></a> 实例。",
