    {
      "source": "Utility methods to work with <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> instances from <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "用于与来自<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanFactoryPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanFactoryPostProcessor</code></a>s 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a>实例一起工作的实用方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Value object to represent a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> for an <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> with a dedicated bean name.",
      "translation": "表示具有专用 Bean 名称的 <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> 的值对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return all bean names for bean definitions that will result in an <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> eventually. We're\nchecking for <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> and the well-known factory beans here to avoid eager initialization of\nthe factory beans. The double lookup is necessary especially for JavaConfig scenarios as people might declare an\n<code>EntityManagerFactory</code> directly.",
      "translation": "返回所有最终会导致生成 <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> 的 Bean 定义名称。我们检查 <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> 以及这些众所周知的工厂 Bean，以避免过早初始化这些工厂 Bean。双重查找对于 JavaConfig 场景尤其必要，因为用户可能会直接声明一个 <code>EntityManagerFactory</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return all bean names for bean definitions that will result in an <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> eventually.",
      "translation": "返回所有最终将导致生成<code>EntityManagerFactory</code>的Bean定义对应的Bean名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>beanDefinitionBiPredicate</code> - predicate to determine whether a <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> bean should be\n         decorated with a <code>SharedEntityManager</code> bean definition.",
      "translation": "<code>beanDefinitionBiPredicate</code> - 用于判断是否应使用 <code>SharedEntityManager</code> BeanDefinition 装饰 <code>EntityManagerFactory</code> Bean 的谓词。",
